Most Important Banking Interview Topics
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Saga Pattern

Manages distributed transactions using compensating actions.

Example:

Debit Account
Credit Account
Send Notification


Rollback if any step fails.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Outbox Pattern

Ensures database and Kafka remain consistent.

Business Table
Outbox Table


CDC tools publish events reliably.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Kafka Exactly Once Semantics (EOS)

Guarantees:

No Lost Events
No Duplicate Events


Mandatory in payment systems.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Event Sourcing

Store events instead of current state.

AccountCreated
MoneyDeposited
MoneyWithdrawn


Provides complete audit history.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. CQRS

Separate Read and Write operations.

Write Model
Read Model


Improves scalability and performance.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6. Circuit Breaker

Protects systems from cascading failures.

States:

Closed
Open
Half-Open


Implemented using Resilience4j.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7. Idempotency

Repeated requests produce the same result.

Example:

Pay ₹10,000


Executed once even if submitted multiple times.
